sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Caller / bio
    participant D as virtio_disk_rw
    participant V as Descriptor / rings
    participant Q as QEMU virtio-blk
    participant T as PLIC / devintr
    participant I as virtio_disk_intr
    Note over C,I: STOCK CODE - caller waits, caller reclaims descriptors
    C->>D: bread miss / bwrite
    D->>D: lock, alloc3_desc
    D->>V: header + data + status
    D->>D: b.disk=1, info[head]=b
    D->>V: avail[slot]=head, fence
    D->>V: avail.idx++, fence
    D->>Q: QUEUE_NOTIFY=0
    D->>D: prepare(b), unlock
    D->>D: sleep [caller only]
    Q->>V: DMA + status, used.idx++
    Q->>T: IRQ 1
    T->>I: claim, dispatch handler
    I->>I: lock, MMIO ACK, fence
    V->>I: used entry: head ID
    I->>C: b.disk=0, wakeup(b)
    I-->>T: unlock, return
    T->>T: plic_complete(irq)
    C->>D: resume, lock, recheck
    D->>D: clear info, free_chain
    D-->>C: unlock, return
